WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.348 --> 00:00:02.693
- See, most people want it easy.

00:00:02.693 --> 00:00:04.957
See, easy come, easy what?

00:00:04.957 --> 00:00:06.258
Easy go.

00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:08.375
What if you live your whole life

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.292
only to discover that it was wrong?

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:15.151
That it was wrong?

00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:17.525
What would your life be like,

00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:18.993
as you look toward the future,

00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:20.891
if you decided,

00:00:20.891 --> 00:00:24.857
"I'm not going to allow
my fears to stop me"?

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.408
- He's one of the world's most renowned

00:00:26.408 --> 00:00:27.933
motivational speakers.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.542
He mastered the science of achievement

00:00:29.542 --> 00:00:32.317
by interviewing hundreds of
successful business leaders

00:00:32.317 --> 00:00:33.774
over three decades.

00:00:33.774 --> 00:00:35.601
He received the Golden Gavel Award

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.132
for Achievement and
Leadership in Communication.

00:00:38.132 --> 00:00:39.074
He's Les Brown,

00:00:39.074 --> 00:00:41.642
and here's my take on his
top 10 rules for success,

00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:42.674
volume two.

00:00:42.674 --> 00:00:44.539
And as always, guys, as
you're watching the videos,

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:46.791
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:48.506
please leave it down in the comments below

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:49.423
