00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:51.391
so other people can be inspired as well.

00:00:51.391 --> 00:00:53.491
Also as you are writing something down,

00:00:53.491 --> 00:00:56.673
it's much more likely to
stick in your head too.

00:00:56.673 --> 00:00:57.710
Enjoy.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.556
