00:01:10.464 --> 00:01:12.705
- Here's what I discovered
that happens to your life,

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.654
that you will go through things,

00:01:14.654 --> 00:01:15.938
and while you're going through them,

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.254
you can't understand why
it's happening to you.

00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:20.863
But after you go through it,

00:01:20.863 --> 00:01:22.297
you get back and you look at it,

00:01:22.297 --> 00:01:24.582
and you say, "Oh, now I understand

00:01:24.582 --> 00:01:27.021
"why I needed that lesson."

00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:27.930
Have you ever had it happen to you?

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:28.763
Raise your hand.

00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:30.268
Has it ever happened to you?
(scattered applause)

00:01:30.268 --> 00:01:33.368
That I couldn't understand it then,

00:01:33.368 --> 00:01:35.680
but after I got through it,

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:38.154
then I saw that that was preparing me

00:01:38.154 --> 00:01:41.280
for bigger and better things.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.530
(applause)

00:01:49.154 --> 00:01:53.057
That as you go through
the challenges of life,

00:01:53.057 --> 00:01:55.879
and you look at it and
embrace whatever comes to you,

00:01:55.879 --> 00:01:57.337
don't run from it.

00:01:57.337 --> 00:01:58.333
Step toward it.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.852
Don't try and duck it like most people do.

00:02:00.852 --> 00:02:03.158
See, most people want it easy.

00:02:03.158 --> 00:02:05.297
See, easy come, easy what?

00:02:05.297 --> 00:02:06.130
Easy go.

00:02:07.238 --> 00:02:11.013
See, but when you go at what
you're going to deal with

00:02:11.013 --> 00:02:14.685
