to make some adjustments
that will open up the key

00:11:54.406 --> 00:11:56.256
to a whole new future for them,

00:11:56.256 --> 00:11:58.944
that will give them access
to the unlimited power

00:11:58.944 --> 00:12:00.884
that they have within themselves.

00:12:00.884 --> 00:12:02.952
That's all that they need.

00:12:02.952 --> 00:12:06.008
So what I want you to do is think about

00:12:06.008 --> 00:12:08.583
something you want for you,

00:12:08.583 --> 00:12:10.974
that's real for you,

00:12:10.974 --> 00:12:12.617
that's important for you,

00:12:12.617 --> 00:12:16.334
that will give your life some
special meaning and power.

00:12:16.334 --> 00:12:19.558
And I don't even want you
to say, "I can do that."

00:12:19.558 --> 00:12:21.801
I don't want you to assume that.

00:12:21.801 --> 00:12:25.066
See, five years ago, when
I started out in this area,

00:12:25.066 --> 00:12:27.675
I would not have been able
to make the mental leap

00:12:27.675 --> 00:12:31.390
that I would be up to
where I am right now.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:35.333
I don't want you to begin
to just psych yourself out.

00:12:35.333 --> 00:12:36.241
No, no.

00:12:36.241 --> 00:12:38.655
I want you to be able to
say something to yourself

00:12:38.655 --> 00:12:40.166
that will enable you to maintain

00:12:40.166 --> 00:12:42.733
a level of integrity with yourself.

00:12:42.733 --> 00:12:43.848
That when you say this,

00:12:43.848 --> 00:12:46.266
even when you face tremendous setbacks,

00:12:46.266 --> 00:12:49.233
it will be a benchmark
to keep you in the game,

00:12:49.233 --> 00:12:52.323
to keep you moving
forward and experimenting

00:12:52.323 --> 00:12:55.219
and readjusting your strategy
and your plan of action,

00:12:55.219 --> 00:12:58.805
continuously looking for ways to win.

00:12:58.805 --> 00:13:00.838
So what is that something?

00:13:00.838 --> 00:13:02.618
When you got an idea you want to move on,

00:13:02.618 --> 00:13:03.564
you might not have the money,

00:13:03.564 --> 00:13:05.597
you might not have the education,

00:13:05.597 --> 00:13:08.189
you might not have the support
or the resources you need.

00:13:08.189 --> 00:13:10.022
What is that something

00:13:11.087 --> 00:13:12.288
that can keep us going,

00:13:12.288 --> 00:13:14.848
that will enable us to act on our dreams?

00:13:14.848 --> 00:13:17.623
What's one of those keys

00:13:17.623 --> 00:13:19.109
that will begin to help us

00:13:19.109 --> 00:13:21.881
to discover the secrets to our dream?

00:13:21.881 --> 00:13:23.489
Here's what I want you to
repeat after me, please,

00:13:23.489 --> 00:13:25.017
with power and conviction.

00:13:25.017 --> 00:13:26.417
Say, "It's possible."

00:13:26.417 --> 00:13:28.698
- [Crowd] It's possible.

00:13:28.698 --> 00:13:30.805
- That's all I want you to do
when you look at your dream.

00:13:30.805 --> 00:13:34.813
Just say to yourself every
day, "It's possible."

00:13:34.813 --> 00:13:37.714
You say that every day to
yourself, "It's possible."

00:13:37.714 --> 00:13:38.837
Because what does that do?

00:13:38.837 --> 00:13:42.504
See, it begins to change
your belief system.

00:13:43.923 --> 00:13:46.930
See, the way in which we
operate, ladies and gentlemen,

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.688
it's a manifestation of what we believe,

00:13:49.688 --> 00:13:51.644
what's possible for us.

00:13:51.644 --> 00:13:53.138
Whatever you've done up to this point,

00:13:53.138 --> 00:13:56.596
all that it really is is a duplication,

00:13:56.596 --> 00:13:59.973
it's a reproduction of what
you believe subconsciously

00:13:59.973 --> 00:14:03.208
that you deserve and what's
possible for your life.

00:14:03.208 --> 00:14:04.708
Before April 1954,

00:14:07.629 --> 00:14:10.636
the common belief, the universal belief,

00:14:10.636 --> 00:14:13.373
because it'd been tried
again and again and again

00:14:13.373 --> 00:14:14.903
and people had failed,

00:14:14.903 --> 00:14:19.208
the belief was that man
was not physically capable

00:14:19.208 --> 00:14:21.654
of breaking the four-minute barrier,

00:14:21.654 --> 00:14:25.229
that he could not run a mile
in less than four minutes.

00:14:25.229 --> 00:14:27.876
That was the belief on the planet.

00:14:27.876 --> 00:14:29.626
It'd never been done.

00:14:30.628 --> 00:14:33.352
But here's what happened,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:14:33.352 --> 00:14:35.602
Roger Bannister came along,

00:14:36.544 --> 00:14:39.151
and he broke the four-minute barrier.

00:14:39.151 --> 00:14:42.594
Now here's what's significant about that.

00:14:42.594 --> 00:14:45.917
Since that time, up to this day,

00:14:45.917 --> 00:14:48.759
over 20,000 people have done it,

00:14:48.759 --> 00:14:51.009
including high school kids.

00:14:53.151 --> 00:14:54.234
What changed?

00:14:55.684 --> 00:14:57.009
20,000 people.

00:14:57.009 --> 00:14:57.955
What changed?

00:14:57.955 --> 00:14:58.817
Here's what happened.

00:14:58.817 --> 00:15:03.343
When they got on the track,
they knew it'd been done.

00:15:03.343 --> 00:15:05.617
And because they knew it'd been done,

00:15:05.617 --> 00:15:08.988
there was a new belief about this barrier,

00:15:08.988 --> 00:15:12.783
about this goal that was unreachable.

00:15:12.783 --> 00:15:17.416
And those 20,000 people
got in a race believing,

00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:19.374
knowing in their heart
that someone had done it,

00:15:19.374 --> 00:15:22.883
that's it's possible
that they could do it.

00:15:22.883 --> 00:15:25.235
And I'm saying that if you know
anybody that had some goal,

00:15:25.235 --> 00:15:29.051
some dream, something they wanted to do

00:15:29.051 --> 00:15:29.929
and they did it,

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:32.298
then I'm saying that
you know in your heart

00:15:32.298 --> 00:15:34.374
that if someone has done it,

00:15:34.374 --> 00:15:35.322
then you can do it.

00:15:35.322 --> 00:15:37.298
It's possible.

00:15:37.298 --> 00:15:40.148
And that if someone can make
their dream become a reality,

00:15:40.148 --> 00:15:42.532
that it's possible that you can make

00:15:42.532 --> 00:15:44.690
your dream become reality.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:48.115
If you constantly remind
yourself after every defeat,

00:15:48.115 --> 00:15:51.178
after every setback, every
time you get knocked down,

00:15:51.178 --> 00:15:52.011
I've got a saying,

00:15:52.011 --> 00:15:54.274
"If life knocks you down,
try and land on your back,

00:15:54.274 --> 00:15:56.957
"because if you can look
up, you can get up."

00:15:56.957 --> 00:15:59.064
See, a lot of people, because of failure,

00:15:59.064 --> 00:16:00.547
they stop, they stop believing.

00:16:00.547 --> 00:16:01.778
Let me share something with you.

00:16:01.778 --> 00:16:04.049
You will fail your way to success.

00:16:04.049 --> 00:16:04.882
Yes.

00:16:04.882 --> 00:16:05.858
Eight out of ten millionaires

00:16:05.858 --> 00:16:07.752
have been financially bankrupt.

00:16:07.752 --> 00:16:10.433
You will fail your way to success.

00:16:10.433 --> 00:16:12.306
It doesn't matter how many times you fail.

00:16:12.306 --> 00:16:13.573
It doesn't matter how many times

00:16:13.573 --> 00:16:15.589
people tell you that you can't do it.

00:16:15.589 --> 00:16:18.986
It doesn't matter if you
don't have a dime in the bank.

00:16:18.986 --> 00:16:21.105
You will fail your way to success.

00:16:21.105 --> 00:16:22.461
We live in a world where we're told

00:16:22.461 --> 00:16:24.113
more about our limitations,

00:16:24.113 --> 00:16:26.008
rather than our potential.

00:16:26.008 --> 00:16:26.995
How many of you have ever been told

00:16:26.995 --> 00:16:27.943
that you couldn't do something?

00:16:27.943 --> 00:16:29.225
Raise your hands, please.

00:16:29.225 --> 00:16:32.345
You know, MIT did a study
that if I say to you,

00:16:32.345 --> 00:16:34.288
"You can't do that,"

00:16:34.288 --> 00:16:36.562
that 16 people have to come along and say,

00:16:36.562 --> 00:16:38.963
"You can do that, you can
do that, you can do that,"

00:16:38.963 --> 00:16:40.373
to neutralize that,

00:16:40.373 --> 00:16:43.898
and the 17th statement that
you hear, "You can do it,"

00:16:43.898 --> 00:16:47.478
will be the one that will finally stick.

00:16:47.478 --> 00:16:50.795
So, you have to watch
who's speaking into you.

00:16:50.795 --> 00:16:54.013
You've got to begin to monitor your mind.

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:57.187
And you've got to begin
to literally be proactive

00:16:57.187 --> 00:16:59.787
in programming yourself to success.

00:16:59.787 --> 00:17:01.527
Be ye not conformed to this world.

00:17:01.527 --> 00:17:03.931
Be ye transformed by the
renewing of your mind.

00:17:03.931 --> 00:17:07.522
You've got to take responsibility
to make that happen.

00:17:07.522 --> 00:17:08.869
And as you begin to do that,

00:17:08.869 --> 00:17:10.994
you'll begin to see some
incredible changes in your life.

00:17:10.994 --> 00:17:13.026
I understand now, when
Earl Nightingale said,

00:17:13.026 --> 00:17:15.001
"All of us are self-made,

00:17:15.001 --> 00:17:18.383
"but only the successful will admit it."

00:17:18.383 --> 00:17:20.327
As you begin to look at your
dreams and look at your goals,

00:17:20.327 --> 00:17:21.160
write this down:

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.077
"Make no your vitamin."

00:17:24.176 --> 00:17:26.902
See, most people stop
short of their dreams

00:17:26.902 --> 00:17:29.252
and park and get off the highway of life,

00:17:29.252 --> 00:17:31.276
because of the rejections of life.

00:17:31.276 --> 00:17:33.136
You will always be rejected.

00:17:33.136 --> 00:17:35.126
It's no big deal.

00:17:35.126 --> 00:17:38.035
Jack Canfield said, "Rejection is a myth."

00:17:38.035 --> 00:17:39.443
It's not like when somebody says, "No,"

00:17:39.443 --> 00:17:41.092
and then they slap you.

00:17:41.092 --> 00:17:44.359
No, it's just, you know, to
me, make no your vitamin.

00:17:44.359 --> 00:17:45.635
Get excited about the no.

00:17:45.635 --> 00:17:48.035
Why? Because every time someone says no,

00:17:48.035 --> 00:17:51.325
that brings you another step to a yes.

00:17:51.325 --> 00:17:52.674
You're getting closer.

00:17:52.674 --> 00:17:56.252
Trust me, you will win if you don't quit.

00:17:56.252 --> 00:17:57.452
You will win if you don't quit.

00:17:57.452 --> 00:18:00.673
Even a broke clock is right twice a day.

00:18:00.673 --> 00:18:03.984
And so, as I began to work on myself,

00:18:03.984 --> 00:18:07.084
I realized that I'm
getting out of one story

00:18:07.084 --> 00:18:09.724
and stepping into another story.

00:18:09.724 --> 00:18:11.593
As I become aware of some things,

00:18:11.593 --> 00:18:13.910
there's still some
things I'm not aware of.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.675
So I'm still growing,
I'm still developing.

00:18:15.675 --> 00:18:17.702
I'm like the lady who said,

00:18:17.702 --> 00:18:19.717
"Lord, I ain't what I want to
be, ain't what I'm going to be,

00:18:19.717 --> 00:18:22.784
"but thank God, I sure ain't what I was."

00:18:22.784 --> 00:18:25.608
But I realize that you
have to work on yourself

00:18:25.608 --> 00:18:27.906
on a regular basis, and write this down,

00:18:27.906 --> 00:18:29.656
"for mental mindset."

00:18:30.841 --> 00:18:33.424
For mental mindset and stamina.

00:18:34.527 --> 00:18:36.840
Because things are going to happen to you.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:37.990
So I went to the next mode,

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:39.649
necessary to start talking to people

00:18:39.649 --> 00:18:41.739
and seeking and asking for what I wanted,

00:18:41.739 --> 00:18:43.940
and leveraging relationships
and trying to find out,

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.329
how do the people do it
that went ahead of me?

00:18:46.329 --> 00:18:47.739
How do they do it?

00:18:47.739 --> 00:18:49.555
And then what is I need to do?

00:18:49.555 --> 00:18:52.615
How is it I need to train
myself, to develop myself?

00:18:52.615 --> 00:18:54.651
What's the resources that will be required

00:18:54.651 --> 00:18:56.882
in order to make it happen?

00:18:56.882 --> 00:18:59.319
And as I start seeking
out and asking questions,

00:18:59.319 --> 00:19:00.848
I start running into people said,

00:19:00.848 --> 00:19:03.491
"I know someone who can help you do that."

00:19:03.491 --> 00:19:06.183
And they helped me get
connected with those people.

00:19:06.183 --> 00:19:09.410
Remember, we have so much
energy that can take us so far.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.759
It's necessary that you hook up

00:19:10.759 --> 00:19:12.389
with some other inner energy

00:19:12.389 --> 00:19:14.143
that can take you to the next level.

00:19:14.143 --> 00:19:16.132
I hooked up with them,
they said, "Les, let's go!"

00:19:16.132 --> 00:19:17.454
I said, "Away we go!"

00:19:17.454 --> 00:19:20.787
(laughter and applause)

00:19:26.181 --> 00:19:27.014
And guess what?

00:19:27.014 --> 00:19:29.359
Here we are! (laughs)

00:19:29.359 --> 00:19:30.640
(applause)

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.807
I love it!

00:19:31.807 --> 00:19:33.422
You want your stuff?

00:19:33.422 --> 00:19:35.855
It's necessary you take
responsibility for it,

00:19:35.855 --> 00:19:38.537
that you make it happen,
that you don't give up,

00:19:38.537 --> 00:19:39.913
that you don't take any objection

00:19:39.913 --> 00:19:42.629
or disappointment or defeats personally,

00:19:42.629 --> 00:19:44.470
that you keep on keeping on,

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:46.122
that you don't decide that I can't make it

00:19:46.122 --> 00:19:48.531
because you can't see th light
at the end of the tunnel,

00:19:48.531 --> 00:19:50.469
that you realize that's
a part of the program.

00:19:50.469 --> 00:19:52.453
And here's something
you've got to resolve.

00:19:52.453 --> 00:19:54.363
Say this to yourself every day.

00:19:54.363 --> 00:19:55.487
See, as long as you're breathing,

00:19:55.487 --> 00:19:56.688
you got a shot at your dream.

00:19:56.688 --> 00:19:57.553
That's the way I resolve.

00:19:57.553 --> 00:19:58.970
Say this, please:

00:19:59.853 --> 00:20:01.379
"It's not over ..."

00:20:01.379 --> 00:20:02.783
- [Crowd] It's not over ...

00:20:02.783 --> 00:20:03.688
- "until I win."

00:20:03.688 --> 00:20:05.353
- [Crowd] Until I win.

00:20:05.353 --> 00:20:06.503
- You got that right.

00:20:06.503 --> 00:20:09.836
(laughter and applause)

00:20:14.794 --> 00:20:16.806
It's not over 'til I win.

00:20:16.806 --> 00:20:19.112
Not over 'til I get through.

00:20:19.112 --> 00:20:20.602
It's not over 'til I get over.

00:20:20.602 --> 00:20:22.981
Not over 'til I get what I want.

00:20:22.981 --> 00:20:24.495
Door can't open today, look out.

00:20:24.495 --> 00:20:26.418
I'm going to come back
and take the hinges off.

00:20:26.418 --> 00:20:27.518
(laughter)

00:20:27.518 --> 00:20:30.403
That's how you got to do that.

00:20:30.403 --> 00:20:31.829
You've got to have that kind of courage,

00:20:31.829 --> 00:20:34.037
that type of determination.

00:20:34.037 --> 00:20:36.894
If you want to make it happen, it's you.

00:20:36.894 --> 00:20:39.597
But you've got to take
personal responsibility

00:20:39.597 --> 00:20:41.097
to make it happen.

00:20:43.248 --> 00:20:44.509
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:20:44.509 --> 00:20:47.943
I made this video to continue
in the Volume Two series.

00:20:47.943 --> 00:20:49.046
I'd love to know what you guys think

00:20:49.046 --> 00:20:50.160
and if we should continue it.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.249
If you want to nominate
somebody else, let me know.

00:20:52.249 --> 00:20:53.615
I'd also really love to know,

00:20:53.615 --> 00:20:54.763
what did you learn from Les today

00:20:54.763 --> 00:20:56.751
that had the biggest
impact on you and why?

00:20:56.751 --> 00:20:58.824
What message are you
going to take from him

00:20:58.824 --> 00:21:01.426
and immediately apply it to your life

00:21:01.426 --> 00:21:02.529
or your business somehow?

00:21:02.529 --> 00:21:03.795
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:21:03.795 --> 00:21:05.366
I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:21:05.366 --> 00:21:06.600
Finally, I wanted to
give a quick shout-out

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.683
to J-Ryze and Lynx.

00:21:07.683 --> 00:21:08.719
Thank you guys so much

00:21:08.719 --> 00:21:11.105
for picking up a copy of
my book, "Your One Word,"

00:21:11.105 --> 00:21:12.868
and that entry into the contest.

00:21:12.868 --> 00:21:16.056
I loved the video, and I
really appreciate your support.

00:21:16.056 --> 00:21:19.416
- We're here to do a major unboxing.

00:21:19.416 --> 00:21:22.699
- Look what I got in the mail today!

00:21:22.699 --> 00:21:24.145
- Exciting!

00:21:24.145 --> 00:21:25.465
- So thank you guys again for watching.

00:21:25.465 --> 00:21:26.615
I believe in you.

00:21:26.615 --> 00:21:28.558
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:21:28.558 --> 00:21:33.125
And whatever your one word is,
much love, I'll see you soon.

00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:36.625
(paper airplane whooshes)

00:21:39.074 --> 00:21:41.848
- Most people are not accumulating wealth.

00:21:41.848 --> 00:21:44.254
Most people are living in poverty.

00:21:44.254 --> 00:21:46.965
Most people are living
far below their potential,

00:21:46.965 --> 00:21:49.198
not because they don't have the capacity,

00:21:49.198 --> 00:21:52.415
not because they have not been
given authority and dominion

00:21:52.415 --> 00:21:55.224
over everything on the face of the Earth,

00:21:55.224 --> 00:21:57.324
but most people are
living like they're living

00:21:57.324 --> 00:21:59.048
because of the fact
that they don't believe

00:21:59.048 --> 00:22:02.138
they can have any more
than what they now have.

00:22:02.138 --> 00:22:03.990
In the book called "The
Mis-Education of the Negro,"

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:05.347
Dr. Carter G. Woodson said,

00:22:05.347 --> 00:22:07.247
"If you can determine
what a man shall think,

00:22:07.247 --> 00:22:08.897
"you'll never have to concern yourself

00:22:08.897 --> 00:22:10.381
"with what he will do.

00:22:10.381 --> 00:22:12.296
"If you can make a man feel inferior,

00:22:12.296 --> 00:22:14.808
"you'll never have to compel
him to seek an inferior status,

00:22:14.808 --> 00:22:16.431
"for he will seek it himself.

00:22:16.431 --> 00:22:19.530
"And if you can make a man
feel justly an outcast,

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:21.573
"you never have to order
him to go to the back door.

00:22:21.573 --> 00:22:23.513
"He'll go without being told;

00:22:23.513 --> 00:22:27.680
"and if there's no door, his
very nature will demand one."

00:22:28.534 --> 00:22:29.939
That's why Scripture reminds us,

00:22:29.939 --> 00:22:31.845
"Be ye not conformed to this world,

00:22:31.845 --> 00:22:36.472
"but be ye transformed by
the renewing of your mind."

00:22:36.472 --> 00:22:39.355
So every day, you have to sell yourself,

00:22:39.355 --> 00:22:41.823
and get out of your
mind those old thoughts,

00:22:41.823 --> 00:22:43.390
that old belief system.

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:46.064
Every day you've got to sell yourself

00:22:46.064 --> 00:22:47.897
on that it's possible.

00:22:49.327 --> 00:22:50.795
But you got to put a new mind in you.

00:22:50.795 --> 00:22:52.028
You got to get out of your mind.

00:22:52.028 --> 00:22:54.762
You got to begin to
restructure your thinking.

00:22:54.762 --> 00:22:58.769
Every day, you've got to begin
to recondition your mind.

00:22:58.769 --> 00:23:01.071
See, many of us go through
life making choices,

00:23:01.071 --> 00:23:04.204
thinking it's our choices, and it's not.

00:23:04.204 --> 00:23:05.362
You want to make your dream come true,

00:23:05.362 --> 00:23:06.594
you got to stay focused.

00:23:06.594 --> 00:23:08.408
Some people rather get
even than get ahead.

00:23:08.408 --> 00:23:10.977
Stay focused on where you want to go.

00:23:10.977 --> 00:23:13.671
I just kept on doing what
I was supposed to do.

00:23:13.671 --> 00:23:16.244
And so I was driving to the radio station.

00:23:16.244 --> 00:23:18.661
My opponent had over $20,000,

00:23:19.902 --> 00:23:21.652
I had less than $800.

00:23:22.626 --> 00:23:23.894
As I was in the radio station,

00:23:23.894 --> 00:23:25.204
the guy said, "You're going
to make a commercial?"

00:23:25.204 --> 00:23:26.436
I said, "Yes."

00:23:26.436 --> 00:23:27.459
He said, "It better be a good one,

00:23:27.459 --> 00:23:29.726
"because that money can't
go pretty far here."

00:23:29.726 --> 00:23:31.969
(laughter)

00:23:31.969 --> 00:23:33.753
And I sat there in the
middle of the control room

00:23:33.753 --> 00:23:35.569
and I was thinking.

00:23:35.569 --> 00:23:38.767
And here's what happens
when you get still:

00:23:38.767 --> 00:23:40.586
Stuff will start coming.

00:23:40.586 --> 00:23:42.742
Something said, "Call your mama.

00:23:42.742 --> 00:23:44.925
"You used to talk about your
mother on the air all the time.

00:23:44.925 --> 00:23:47.099
"Ask her to say a few words for you.

00:23:47.099 --> 00:23:49.118
"That'll be a different
kind of political spot."

00:23:49.118 --> 00:23:50.735
(laughter)

00:23:50.735 --> 00:23:52.545
So I called my mama.

00:23:52.545 --> 00:23:55.584
And I had a gospel record
playing in the background.

00:23:55.584 --> 00:23:58.759
(laughter and applause)

00:23:58.759 --> 00:24:01.176
(Les laughs)

00:24:03.208 --> 00:24:04.452
And then I had my mother say,

00:24:04.452 --> 00:24:06.817
"Hello, this is Mrs. Mamie Brown.

00:24:06.817 --> 00:24:10.492
"When I raised my sons, I
raised them to be good children.

00:24:10.492 --> 00:24:11.808
"When they got out of hand,

00:24:11.808 --> 00:24:13.908
"I'd beat their behind
and made 'em go right.

00:24:13.908 --> 00:24:16.392
"Please vote for my son, he's a good boy."

00:24:16.392 --> 00:24:19.725
(laughter and applause)

00:24:24.791 --> 00:24:26.357
Usually in a State Representative race,

00:24:26.357 --> 00:24:30.489
maybe 3 or 4,000 people will
come out to vote in a primary.

00:24:30.489 --> 00:24:34.266
In that primary race, over
27,000 people came out and voted,

00:24:34.266 --> 00:24:35.750
said, "I'm voting for Les Brown,

00:24:35.750 --> 00:24:37.831
"'cause his mama say he's a good boy."

00:24:37.831 --> 00:24:40.649
(laughter)

00:24:40.649 --> 00:24:42.681
I won, ladies and gentlemen!

00:24:42.681 --> 00:24:43.538
I won!

00:24:43.538 --> 00:24:45.788
(applause)

00:24:52.132 --> 00:24:54.315
So you've got to be
willing to stay focused,

00:24:54.315 --> 00:24:56.556
to be creative, to be relentless.

00:24:56.556 --> 00:24:58.221
Because things are going to happen to you

00:24:58.221 --> 00:25:00.655
when you're working on your dream.

